{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>東涌發生奪命火警。今日（15日）凌晨4時42分，裕東苑喜東閣一個中層單位冒煙起火，驚動多名住戶報警，大約300人疏散到安全位置。消防員接報到場，</p><p>其間消防員在火場發現一具女性遺體，女死者生前獨居上址。</p><p>根據網上圖片，涉事單位冒出大量濃煙，多人到地下位置暫避。就現場所見，大廈外牆熏黑一片，涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131852041262600192415907.jpeg/rsBqpycQxUM9auNrwZPa_DsEd2QdwJORaWngI2lp4CM\" alt=\"涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）\"><figcaption>涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131852038141906944286701.jpeg/S6gY_4A8Qr6_0RoYYXXqFZbqoAciWkaHPHvGQTx7xkE\" alt=\"涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）\"><figcaption>涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131851489854099456824690.jpeg/z2u8kgmZjJDy13oHZBdGSAutJMqSmRaCgQ4ZK4EOGSs\" alt=\"多人到地下位置暫避。（Threads@_blackcat_11_16圖片）\"><figcaption>多人到地下位置暫避。（Threads@_blackcat_11_16圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131858366323232768958103.jpeg/nuo9g0p-EIn7BB3uVaBtKWtg6gwQl89W6i2DEdAtgxE\" alt=\"大廈外牆熏黑一片。\"><figcaption>大廈外牆熏黑一片。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131858373780967424541082.jpeg/YUwcfqGxww7PuFqBPZxYHsU4BznVdB9WyCiLQPIoi0A\" alt=\"住客離開大廈。\"><figcaption>住客離開大廈。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131858370110820352046239.jpeg/Ebg7bUMbnOlYvAdC9rGlh3zWQOvtbNhKlWQnZq9kJ2Y\" alt=\"消防在場調查。\"><figcaption>消防在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131858246521327616948250.jpeg/v7ymTNcwPRgpaGF59DEcDytlj4BuILE5aM1IxlLNSMY\" alt=\"涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。\"><figcaption>涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T23:50:30.249791+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}